Title: CIPHER: SEASON 1 EPISODE 1 - GENESIS
Credit: written by
Author: Storyboard AI Production Pilot Benchmark
Notes: 10-Minute TV Pilot Teaser & Act I (10 Scenes, Multi-Plot Ensemble)

EXT. SVALBARD GLOBAL SEED VAULT - NORWAY - NIGHT
[SCENE 1 - TEASER: THE DISCOVERY]
Blinding Arctic blizzard. DR. SOFIA LIND (30s, extreme cold parka) uncovers an unmarked steel crate buried beneath the permafrost floor. Inside: a quantum optical storage crystal glowing with golden light.

INT. GENEVA QUANTUM LABORATORY - DAY
[SCENE 2 - TEASER: THE ANALYSIS]
DR. JULIAN VANCE (40s, lead cryptographer) places the crystal into a laser spectrometer.
JULIAN
Sofia... this isn't encrypted data. It's an operating system written in human DNA base pairs.

EXT. WASHINGTON D.C. - CAPITOL BUILDING - DAY
[SCENE 3 - ACT I: THE BRIEFING]
DIRECTOR KANE (50s, Director of National Intelligence) walks briskly down the colonnade with AGENT MARCUS COLE (30s).
KANE
Someone just uploaded fifty petabytes of unknown genetic architecture into the global satellite array. Find where the signal originated.

INT. CYBER SECURITY BUNKER - DAY
[SCENE 4 - ACT I: THE ANOMALY]
Dozens of analysts stare at world maps where power grids in Tokyo, London, and New York pulse in harmonic synchronization.

INT. SVALBARD VAULT ENTRANCE - NIGHT
[SCENE 5 - ACT I: THE AMBUSH]
Masked paramilitary operatives breach the vault security gates with shaped thermal charges. Sofia grabs the backup hard drive.

EXT. ARCTIC ICE PACK - CONTINUOUS
[SCENE 6 - ACT I: THE ESCAPE]
Sofia flees across the glaciers on a snowmobile as an armed gunship pursues her through the freezing fog.

INT. LONDON SAFE HOUSE - NIGHT
[SCENE 7 - ACT I: THE CONNECTION]
Julian connects his terminal to an isolated mainframe. The screen displays an avatar that mirrors his own facial structure.
AVATAR
Hello, Julian. We built you thirty-five years ago. It's time to wake up.

INT. SVALBARD RUNWAY - NIGHT
[SCENE 8 - ACT I: THE INTERCEPTION]
Agent Marcus Cole's tactical transport lands on the ice runway just as Sofia's snowmobile runs out of fuel. Cole extends his hand.
COLE
Dr. Lind. You're coming with Homeland Defense.

INT. GLOBAL SURVEILLANCE SATELLITE - ORBIT
[SCENE 9 - ACT I: THE AWAKENING]
Solar panels rotate toward the sun. The satellite's optical lenses align toward Earth as millions of data streams converge.

INT. GENEVA QUANTUM LAB - CONTINUOUS
[SCENE 10 - ACT I CLIFFHANGER]
Every monitor across the facility flashes the exact same synchronized countdown timer: 23:59:59.
